# WP-056 golden: Ember Toss throws an arcing Fire projectile that lands on the dummy 7 m ahead (record with `lf-tools replay record-script`). Each line:
# <ticks> <move_x> <move_z> [BUTTONS], plus `cmd` lines. The player rests at the Lantern and
# raises Devotion by 20 (every Litany's requirement is at most 20), then attunes Ember Toss and casts it at dummy_front. The reliquary
# and the Litanies come from the `litany_range` scenario.
seed 5621
scenario litany_range
10 0 0            # settle on the ground
cmd Rest
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd Equip 32 15022     # attune Ember Toss
2 0 0
1 0 0 LIGHT          # the arc
120 0 0
